          "sourceId": "columbia-southern-catalog-2026-2028-transfer-sources-2026-11-26",
          "text": "A minimum of 25% of an associate or bachelor’s degree must be completed at CSU. Transfer credit for experiential learning may not exceed 25% of the degree program."
        },
